From: Danny Lin <danny@kdrag0n.dev>
Date: Tue, 5 Oct 2021 19:49:52 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 189/226] SystemUI: Speed up actions expansion animation

400 ms feels too long for this, especially when the actions already take
so long to show up due to how long saving the screenshot takes.

Change-Id: I67a874adeb42cbde31e9b4f7bddc59481dc2f69f
---
 .../android/systemui/screenshot/MessageContainerController.kt   | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/screenshot/MessageContainerController.kt b/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/screenshot/MessageContainerController.kt
index 28bff51dc0..e99ee8bd94 100644
--- a/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/screenshot/MessageContainerController.kt
+++ b/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/screenshot/MessageContainerController.kt
@@ -123,6 +123,6 @@ constructor(
     }
 
     companion object {
-        const val MESSAGE_EXPANSION_DURATION_MS: Long = 400
+        const val MESSAGE_EXPANSION_DURATION_MS: Long = 300
     }
 }
